<title>USA: Petroleum Geo gets $150 mln credit line.</title>
<headline>Petroleum Geo gets $150 mln credit line.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petroleum Geo-Services ASA said Thursday it entered into a $150 million Multi-Currency Revolving Credit Facility with a syndicate of international banks lead by Chase Manhattan Bank Norge AS, as agent.</p>
<p>The three year revolving credit facility will be used for general corporate purposes, including but not limited to, seasonal working capital needs and investments in multi-client seismic surveys.</p>
<p>PGS can borrow various currencies under this facility.</p>
</text>
